[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0010","text":"锵～！\n快看快看，制片人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0020","text":"雏菜好可爱～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0030","text":"哈哈，真的\n很合身哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0040","text":"呀哈～，对吧～？\n雏菜也这么觉得！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0050","text":"嗯，真想快点让粉丝们也看看"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0060","text":"嗯～！\n……好，那，制片人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0070","text":"用雏菜的手机拍张照～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0080","text":"好！\n交给我吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0090","text":"啊哈～\n好想快点发到推上啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12300100_02_0100","text":"这个什么时候可以公开～？"}]
